cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Gov Atlas: a sourced atlas of government structures"
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it, and cite the underlying official source
  recorded with each figure.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  How many ministries each country has and what they are called, with a verbatim-quoted,
  archived citation for every figure. Counts are derived from curated per-ministry records
  rather than entered by hand, and bodies that do not meet the counting definition are
  recorded with the reason they were excluded.
authors:
  - name: Gov Atlas contributors
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - government
  - public administration
  - ministries
  - cabinets
  - comparative politics
  - open data
